title: SupervisorEnding
---
监督员: 惊——喜。 #line:supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_001 #source:supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_001 #portrait:JD06
监督员: 做过什么你自己清楚。 #line:supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_002 #source:supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_002 #portrait:JD06
监督员: 看来你要跟我走一趟了。 #line:supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_003 #source:supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_003 #portrait:JD06
监督员: 进去之后，记得好好表现。 #line:supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_004 #source:supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_004 #portrait:JD06
监督员: 也许就不会那么早迎来净化。 #line:supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_005 #source:supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_005 #portrait:JD06
监督员: 我们之间也能多玩一会，不是吗？ #line:supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_006 #source:supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_006 #portrait:JD06
